---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/connect.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Connect · Farrel Islami Putra"
  pageKey="connect"
  description="Kanal resmi Farrel Islami Putra: daftar profil sosial terverifikasi, dua alamat email yang selalu terbuka, dan moto pribadi di bagian penutup halaman."
>
  <!-- ============ SOCIAL + CONTACT ============ -->
  <section class="social-section" id="profiles" aria-labelledby="social-heading">
    <!-- V6.5 §4.5: jaringan konstelasi generatif, satu-satunya ornamen
         yang bereaksi pada kursor. -->
    <canvas class="ambient-canvas ambient-canvas--social" data-effect="constellation" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="social-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="section-inner social-inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">01 / KANAL TERVERIFIKASI · FIND ME ELSEWHERE</p>
      <div class="social-heading-row">
        <h1 class="display-heading" id="social-heading">
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line">Mari tetap</span></span>
          <span class="line-mask"><span class="line"><em>terhubung.</em></span></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="social-intro" id="social-intro">Daftar profil resmi dan arsip dokumentasi yang saya kelola di GitHub (@Fryel23 &amp; @Fryel32), LinkedIn, Instagram, serta folder riset terbuka di Google Drive.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="social-grid" id="social-grid"></div>
      <p class="social-footnote">BUKA PROFIL RESMI ↗ <span>HANYA TAUTAN TERVERIFIKASI.</span></p>

      <div class="contact-block" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <span class="contact-stamp" aria-hidden="true">POST / 2026</span>
        <div class="ornament ornament-contact-envelope" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" focusable="false">
            <rect x="4" y="10" width="32" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
            <path d="M4 10 L20 22 L36 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-heading">
          <span class="mini-label">02 / SURAT ELEKTRONIK · SAY HELLO</span>
          <h3 id="contact-heading">Ingin berdiskusi melalui email? Kedua kotak masuk ini aktif.</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div class="contact-card contact-card--personal">
            <span class="contact-wave contact-wave--1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="contact-wave contact-wave--2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="contact-wave contact-wave--3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="contact-label">EMAIL PRIBADI</span>
            <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:kktwinf2008@gmail.com">kktwinf2008@gmail.com</a>
            <button class="copy-button" type="button" data-copy="kktwinf2008@gmail.com" aria-label="Copy personal email address">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2" /><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1" /></svg>
              <span class="copy-button-label">Salin</span>
            </button>
            <span class="contact-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-card contact-card--university">
            <span class="contact-label">EMAIL KAMPUS (UNIKOM)</span>
            <a class="contact-address" href="mailto:farrel.10126092@mahasiswa.unikom.ac.id">farrel.10126092@mahasiswa.unikom.ac.id</a>
            <button class="copy-button" type="button" data-copy="farrel.10126092@mahasiswa.unikom.ac.id" aria-label="Copy university email address">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2" /><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1" /></svg>
              <span class="copy-button-label">Salin</span>
            </button>
            <span class="contact-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="contact-note">Ada pertanyaan tentang riset AQI Cirebon, masukan teknis, atau ide kolaborasi? Silakan hubungi melalui salah satu alamat email di atas.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="transition-ribbon" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>

  <!-- ============ CLOSING ============ -->
  <section class="closing-section" id="closing">
    <div class="closing-top">
      <span>THANKS FOR TAKING A LOOK</span>
      <span>CONCEPT, DESIGN &amp; CODE<br />MADE AS A LEARNING PROJECT</span>
    </div>
    <p class="closing-motto"><span class="motto-label">PERSONAL MOTTO</span><span id="motto-text">“Great things happen to those who never stop believing, striving, learning, and being grateful.”</span></p>
    <dl class="closing-colophon" aria-label="Colophon">
      <div><dt>TYPE</dt><dd>Space Grotesk / DM Mono</dd></div>
      <div><dt>STACK</dt><dd>Astro + CSS + JS + GSAP + Lenis</dd></div>
      <div><dt>BUILD</dt><dd>2026 · VOL. 01</dd></div>
      <div><dt>MAINTAINED</dt><dd>By hand, in source code</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="ornament ornament-footer-measure" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <h2 class="closing-name" id="closing-name">
      <span class="closing-solid line-mask"><span class="line">FARREL</span></span>
      <span class="closing-outline line-mask"><span class="line">ISLAMI PUTRA</span><span class="closing-outline-fill line" aria-hidden="true">ISLAMI PUTRA</span></span>
    </h2>
    <div class="closing-baseline" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="baseline-end">00</span>
      <span class="baseline-line"></span>
      <span class="baseline-end">100</span>
    </div>
    <div class="closing-bottom">
      <a href="#top" class="back-top">BACK TO TOP ↑</a>
      <p>Arsip tentang kode, data, dan hal-hal yang masih akan datang.</p>
      <span class="closing-copyright">© <span id="year-now">2026</span> · PERSONAL ARCHIVE</span>
      <span class="closing-stamp" aria-hidden="true">ARCHIVE / CLOSED</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import '../scripts/global.js';
  import '../scripts/connect.js';
</script>
